              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "happy headless hawaiian turkey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tasty simple recipe. Couldn't find shrimp consomme either so used twice the beef broth instead. Cut the size of the broth to a quarter of that in the recipe, but used the same amount of dill and green onion so there was lots of flavor. also added low carb shirataki noodles.",
            "datePublished": "2012-10-28T00:35:51.370Z"
