              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elizabeth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This soup is ready in a flash, which is great! I agree with other reviewers that it needs something more. I added kale when the shrimp went in, and I though it was a tasty and healthy addition. I also sprinkled shredded parmesan on the top before serving. I will make this again.",
